{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_23737","headline":"和集贤刘学士早朝作 · 白居易","name":"和集贤刘学士早朝作","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"吟君昨日早朝诗，金御炉前唤仗时。\n烟吐白龙头宛转，扇开青雉尾参差。\n暂留春殿多称屈，合入纶闱即可知。\n从此摩霄去非晚，鬓边未有一茎丝。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"白居易","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_23737.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_23737","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}